WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.350
Crouching heavy punch starts at the shown near-corner spacing.

2
00:00:01.350 --> 00:00:02.050
Perfect medium Flash Knuckle launches Ryu.

3
00:00:02.050 --> 00:00:02.800
Jumping medium punch catches Ryu in the air.

4
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:03.600
The delayed short-held air light Knuckle continues the juggle.

5
00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:04.600
Light Rising Uppercut completes the juggle.

6
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:05.800
Luke lands next to the knocked-down Ryu.
